# .gitattributes
# Line ending rules for the TestRoute repository (spec rule 1.7).
#
# Text files are normalized to LF inside the repository and converted to the
# platform default on checkout. Windows batch files are forced to CRLF on every
# checkout because cmd.exe can misparse labels and GOTO targets in LF-only .bat
# files. Binary formats are marked so git never rewrites their bytes.

* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
